    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a></i> </p><p>When you use the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Disarm\" title=\"Force Disarm\">Force Disarm</a></i> Force Power, you can change the time it takes to activate it to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>; if you do so, your opponent does not gain the normal +10 bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> normally associated with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarming\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disarming\">Disarming</a>. </p>",
